url: "https://github.com/anfa-majid/forecast-error-semantics-kubernetes-autoscaling"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility artifact for a controlled empirical study of how forecast
  errors with similar aggregate accuracy can produce different scaling,
  readiness, service-level, and resource outcomes under a fixed predictive
  Kubernetes autoscaling policy. The artifact contains the benchmark,
  controllers, deterministic workloads and forecasts, experiment protocols,
  analysis-ready data, statistical programs, reference results, and a local
  functional reproduction workflow.
keywords:
  - Kubernetes
  - autoscaling
  - workload forecasting
  - forecast error
  - reproducibility
  - empirical software engineering
